 "notes": "21st edition. Survey: Global Risks Perception Survey 2025-2026, over 1,300 respondents, 33 risks, responses collected 12 August to 22 September 2025. Same method as 2025: severity over 2 and 10 years (Figure 3, top 10 each) and one-risk current-year question (Figure 2). Current-year entries are the top 8 of 33 bars (ties at 7% and 4% in printed order). 'Cyber espionage and warfare' (2025) is printed as 'Cyber insecurity' in 2026; 'Erosion of human rights and/or civic freedoms' gains 'of'. Category read from the figure colour key. The PDF fetched on 2026-09-27 carries a modification date of 2026-02-03, after the January launch; a revision after launch is possible and not checked."
